OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan set for first
OL,4,Ajoint engagement in Nottingham since UK
OL,5,Areturn
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are due
OL,8,Fto visit Nottingham on Thursday, in
OL,9,Fwhat will be their first royal-style
OL,10,Fjoint engagement since returning to the
OL,11,FUK
OL,13,FHarry and Meghan are due in the city
OL,14,Fwhere they made their first joint
OL,15,Fappearance after announcing their
OL,16,Fengagement in 2017
OL,18,FThe pair will visit a number of
OL,19,Forganisations, including a community
OL,20,Frecording studio that Harry has been to
OL,21,Fbefore, most recently in 2025
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
